	"FriendlyName": "Blueprint Pin Tools",
	"Description": "Editor-only helpers for reading and writing Blueprint graph node PIN DEFAULTS from Python. Stock UE Python cannot reach them: UEdGraph.Nodes is a UPROPERTY, but UEdGraphPin is a plain struct rather than a UObject, so its DefaultObject is invisible to the scripting layer. This plugin closes that gap.",
